{"title":"快速上手","setting":{"lock":false,"debug":false,"historyPanel":false},"version":1,"data":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"04b05012-692a-4afe-bc0d-d590041b775d","data-toc-id":"04b05012-692a-4afe-bc0d-d590041b775d","level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"创建页面"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"Y7gYp_1YkP6l-2bSXmjU5"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"点击侧边菜单下方 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code","attrs":{"class":"inline-code"}}],"text":"+"},{"type":"text","text":" 就可以创建一个一级页面。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"D7nzrtUcCgeT07hEzEzLZ"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"创建的页面，可以是文档，同时还可以做为一个父级目录。当鼠标移动到标题时，会出现更多菜单选项。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"c27b1753-88f0-4913-99a9-85b1285241c5","data-toc-id":"c27b1753-88f0-4913-99a9-85b1285241c5","level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"创建子页面"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"ePjGlW-oWIFSOyDBuc6eH"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"当更新菜单出现后，选择 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code","attrs":{"class":"inline-code"}}],"text":"+"},{"type":"text","text":" 号就可以添加一个子页面了。以此类推，可以无限制的创建下去。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"fce962b1-55d9-4e5b-b9a7-a2dfffe9365c","data-toc-id":"fce962b1-55d9-4e5b-b9a7-a2dfffe9365c","level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"删除页面"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"LtywRpKo--ZDuL0Dmhss1"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"当需要对页面进行删除时，同样将鼠标移动到侧边菜单文档列表上，放在需要删除文档标题上，此时，选择更多按钮，下拉选择删除即可。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"Sl8T78HyIL069A2CuQilB"},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"注意"},{"type":"text","text":" 当你们文档中包含子文档时，请谨慎操作，文档在删除后将无法恢复。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"id":"2c20c0fa-aada-42ae-95d4-4c446073fc9e","data-toc-id":"2c20c0fa-aada-42ae-95d4-4c446073fc9e","level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"文档移动"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"id":"SQPxmowSGaE9jCCudipaD"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"当需要对文档进行移动排序时，可以拖动文档标题，上下移动到你需要调整的位置。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{